opencode-labview-mcp
====================

This package is an unofficial installer for the LabVIEW MCP server published by
Zuehlke Engineering at https://github.com/Zuehlke/labview-mcp.

It does not contain, modify or redistribute the LabVIEW MCP server binary. At
install time it downloads an official GitHub release asset (labview-mcp.zip),
verifies it against the release's own labview-mcp.sha256 file, and unpacks it
into a local directory. All LabVIEW automation is performed by that upstream
binary.

The agent definitions under agents/ are derived from the Claude Code agent
definitions shipped in the upstream repository and are redistributed here under
the upstream project's license. They have been adapted for OpenCode: front
matter fields were translated and the class-generator handoff was rewritten,
because OpenCode subagents cannot launch further subagents.

Upstream project: https://github.com/Zuehlke/labview-mcp
Upstream license: see the LICENSE file in the release archive.

